@startuml st01-oferta
!include _estilo.iuml
title Máquina de estados de Oferta (RE-01..RE-05)
[*] --> OPEN : crear [grupos válidos y expediente no vacío]
OPEN --> ACCEPTED : aceptar(u) [u <> creador] / notificar a ambas partes
OPEN --> INACTIVE : bloqueo del creador
OPEN --> CLOSED : cerrar [creador o administrador]
ACCEPTED --> CLOSED : cerrar [creador, aceptante o administrador]
OPEN --> CLOSED : eliminar entidad padre / notificar
ACCEPTED --> CLOSED : eliminar entidad padre / notificar
CLOSED --> [*]
state ACCEPTED : entry / habilitar chat
state CLOSED : entry / chat en solo lectura
@enduml
